S","title":"Miracle in Milan","overview":"Once upon a time a wise and kind old woman discovers a baby in her cabbage patch. She brings up the child and, when she dies, the boy, Totò, enters an orphanage. Totò leaves the orphanage a happy young man, and looks for work in post-war Milan. He ends up with the homeless and organizes them to build a shanty town in a vacant lot. But when greedy developers threaten the community’s land, Totò will need all the help he can get in order to find an impossible way out.","tagline":"An impudent, riotous laugh on the lives and morals of our day!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mUzjlwrnN9dnoR5BHOACPDLPQqd.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/auItHwCI7tvJ8C5f2B0lS5zjDZQ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":43379,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mUzjlwrnN9dnoR5BHOACPDLPQqd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mUzjlwrnN9dnoR5BHOACPDLPQqd.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mUzjlwrnN9dnoR5BHOACPDLPQqd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mUzjlwrnN9dnoR5BHOACPDLPQqd.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7meKKyiUjfaZ0QoDh9FPixbk7GN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7meKKyiUjfaZ0QoDh9FPixbk7GN.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o9DniNWzymvTcDpqp7Eesp5lOle.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o9DniNWzymvTcDpqp7Eesp5lOle.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bmterGtCiwB4fkn02PARFZCkv27.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmd